1
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:01,960
Didn't you say to come at 8:00 a.m.?

2
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,320
Why are you so early?

3
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:05,120
You're early too.

4
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,960
By the way,

5
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:09,000
I made a plan based on your schedule.

6
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:10,080
It's here.

7
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:12,160
We can proceed according to this.

8
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:18,160
From Monday to Friday,
I'm free at 10:00 p.m.

9
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:20,240
You can rearrange it.

10
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:25,200
Okay. I'll give it to you after I'm done.

11
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:31,320
Don't worry.

12
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:35,040
We can submit all competition materials
before the end of the semester.

13
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:36,280
It won't affect finals.

14
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:58,080
When reviewing,
take note of a few metabolic processes.

15
00:02:58,160 --> 00:03:01,880
Photosynthesis and nitrogen fixation
won't be on the exam.

16
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:04,760
Okay, prepare well for the final exam.

17
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,200
Class dismissed.

18
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,640
Wait, everyone.

19
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:11,920
I have something to say.

20
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:14,600
We've partnered
with the Qingyi Nature Conservancy

21
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,360
to organize a fundraiser.

22
00:03:16,440 --> 00:03:18,040
Here's the donation intent form.

23
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:20,240
Let's do our part for nature.

24
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:22,360
Check the box

25
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:23,560
and sign.

26
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:25,720
Donations will be collected…

27
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:28,000
Zheng Yu, you haven't filled it out yet.

28
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:30,040
Class monitor, can't you tell?

29
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,960
There's no way she will donate.

30
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:34,680
Really, it's the rest of us
who should be donating to her!

31
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:47,440
What?

32
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:49,400
You said you should donate to me.

33
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:51,080
Don't just talk.

34
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:55,000
Crazy.

35
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:09,440
Class monitor.

36
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:11,080
I'll donate extra for Zheng Yu.

37
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,160
Thank you.

38
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:16,880
Help pass these out.

39
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:20,640
You're so good to her.

40
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:22,400
- Plus mine.
- Mine too.

41
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:32,520
DONATION FORM

42
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:35,240
You wimped out.

43
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:36,920
She's a crazy…

44
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:39,920
Sorry.

45
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:44,240
You just watch.

46
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:46,360
I'll teach her a lesson sooner or later.

47
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:48,280
What?

48
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:51,080
For the final exam,
you must skate five times.

49
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:54,480
You must demonstrate
all four moves that you've learned.

50
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:57,000
The forward cross, the backward cross,

51
00:04:57,080 --> 00:04:59,200
the fish, and the snake.

52
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:00,880
For the last move, it's freestyle.

53
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:01,920
Is that clear?

54
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:04,200
- Yes.
- Yes.

55
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:06,480
We'll use the same groups as before.

56
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,720
First group, get ready.

57
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:38,600
Next group.

58
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:41,280
It's our turn.

59
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,840
Let's go.

60
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,200
All right.

61
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:39,680
Get going.

62
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,800
Let me see.

63
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:42,960
So what's the score?

64
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,240
Let me see.

65
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:45,880
I want to see. I'm curious.

66
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:48,520
How did you do?

67
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:51,200
There's a crowd. We got told to leave.

68
00:06:52,080 --> 00:06:55,240
He says he will announce it
with the overall results.

69
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:56,880
You improved fast.

70
00:06:57,880 --> 00:06:58,840
Thanks for the tip.

71
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:00,360
I shouldn't have told you.

72
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:02,560
As expected of the number one,
everything comes easy for you.

73
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,200
Not that easily, actually.

74
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:08,400
Look.

75
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,960
I secretly put in the effort.

76
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,000
Don't tell anyone.

77
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:21,400
I've submitted the competition materials.

78
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:22,800
Okay.

79
00:07:25,640 --> 00:07:28,440
I've been meaning to ask.
Why do you work so hard?

80
00:07:29,320 --> 00:07:32,840
You come to the campus so early
and leave so late.

81
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:36,080
You spend weekends in the lab
or the library.

82
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:38,000
You don't seem to lack anything.

83
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:39,840
Why choose such a difficult way?

84
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:41,640
What do you think?

85
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:45,480
Because you don't want to lose
to your top scholar brother.

86
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:55,680
I watched an interview video
of Zhou Guanqi online.

87
00:07:55,760 --> 00:07:57,000
You happened to be in it.

88
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:01,320
If I had such an incredible brother,

89
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,960
I would be under a lot of pressure.

90
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,040
Zheng Yu.

91
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:11,240
Don't assume that a few conversations
and a few meetings

92
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:12,520
make us close friends.

93
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:16,120
Don't you think
that is a personal question?

94
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,680
Only one person gets the award.

95
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:21,240
Our rollerblade class grades are close.

96
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:23,480
Rather than asking about these things,

97
00:08:24,080 --> 00:08:25,840
you're better off studying.

98
00:08:36,159 --> 00:08:37,919
<i>Those bright moments</i>

99
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,919
<i>always appear so indistinct.</i>

100
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:43,880
<i>Only at the moment of being hurt</i>

101
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:46,480
<i>does a relationship feel real.</i>

102
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:52,760
<i>I have yet to understand</i>
<i>that a person arrives</i>

103
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:55,240
<i>with all their yesterdays behind them.</i>

104
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:13,920
LIYUAN BUILDING 9

105
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:26,880
QINGYI'S TOP SCHOLAR

106
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:28,720
ZHOU GUANQI INTERVIEW

107
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:32,840
<i>Right, there's also that post.</i>

108
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:35,720
DOES ANYONE KNOW WHAT QINGYI'S TOP SCHOLAR
SIX YEARS AGO, ZHOU GUANQI, IS DOING NOW?

109
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:42,960
<i>Zhou Guanqi passed away long ago.</i>

110
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:53,160
<i>How did he die?</i>

111
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:31,000
NANSHAN BOTANICAL GARDEN

112
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:01,720
Hey.

113
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:04,720
Ms. Zhou, when will you be here?

114
00:11:04,800 --> 00:11:07,640
Yanzhou has been waiting here
for nearly an hour.

115
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:09,520
<i>I've been so busy that I forgot.</i>

116
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:11,120
<i>Is Yanzhou next to you?</i>

117
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:12,640
<i>Put him on the phone.</i>

118
00:11:16,880 --> 00:11:18,080
It's Ms. Zhou.

119
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:21,800
<i>Yanzhou, the weather is terrible.</i>

120
00:11:21,880 --> 00:11:24,280
<i>The forecast predicts strong winds later.</i>

121
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:27,440
<i>Will your school field trip be canceled?</i>

122
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:28,760
<i>Are you still going?</i>

123
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:30,280
<i>Why don't I call the school?</i>

124
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:32,080
<i>- Let's not go.</i>
- All right.

125
00:11:32,680 --> 00:11:34,080
<i>Okay, let's do that.</i>

126
00:11:34,160 --> 00:11:35,520
<i>Stay with your brother.</i>

127
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:38,280
<i>But don't bother him.</i>
<i>It's a critical period for him.</i>

128
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:39,680
Ms. Zhou, you…

129
00:11:45,920 --> 00:11:48,760
I already called a cab.
It will be here soon.

130
00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:52,280
Yanzhou.

131
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:55,200
I'll go with you.

132
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:37,600
ZHOU GUANQI PASSED AWAY LONG AGO.

133
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:48,240
CHEN YANZHOU

134
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:50,880
<i>Are you studying at home</i>
<i>for the next few days?</i>

135
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:05,440
Don't lock it.

136
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:09,200
Have you seen a kid's watch?

137
00:13:09,280 --> 00:13:11,760
Someone found it.
It's in the box on the counter.

138
00:13:16,120 --> 00:13:17,240
Zheng Yu.

139
00:13:18,240 --> 00:13:19,080
What is it?

140
00:13:19,160 --> 00:13:21,840
Before locking up today,
did you check the shelf items?

141
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:23,840
I did.

142
00:13:24,400 --> 00:13:25,800
Here's a heads-up.

143
00:13:25,880 --> 00:13:27,040
I saw on the news today

144
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:28,920
that someone is buying expired items

145
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:31,360
when the salesclerks aren't
paying attention.

146
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:33,760
Then they file a complaint
at the Industrial and Commercial Bureau.

147
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:35,320
The fine is tenfold then.

148
00:13:36,160 --> 00:13:39,600
That will never happen
at our store, right?

149
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:41,200
Of course not.

150
00:14:02,880 --> 00:14:04,800
I'm so sleepy.

151
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:08,000
How are you doing?

152
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:11,400
I still have so much to memorize.

153
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:15,360
Last-minute cramming
is better than not cramming at all.

154
00:14:17,880 --> 00:14:19,080
Unlike the top students.

155
00:14:20,400 --> 00:14:22,040
They have their own challenges.

156
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:24,920
I heard them say

157
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:27,960
that the Vitality Award
will likely go to Chen Yanzhou.

158
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:31,480
Is that the guy who wouldn't even
give me a bottle of water?

159
00:14:32,800 --> 00:14:34,240
Zheng Yu should win instead.

160
00:14:35,480 --> 00:14:36,560
Dropped the grudge?

161
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:15,840
MICROBIOLOGY CLOSED-BOOK EXAM,
90 MINUTES ALLOTTED

162
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:47,840
Finally.

163
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:51,480
After the immunology exam, I can go home.

164
00:15:51,560 --> 00:15:54,280
EXAM SCHEDULE, IMMUNOLOGY

165
00:15:57,560 --> 00:15:59,320
RICE BALL

166
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:17,680
YOUR TEAM ADVANCED
TO THE EXCELLENCE CUP FINALS

167
00:17:36,320 --> 00:17:39,080
Fifteen minutes left
until the exam is over.

168
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:41,680
Students, please make use of your time.

169
00:17:41,760 --> 00:17:43,480
Double-check your class,

170
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:45,320
name, and student ID number.

171
00:17:59,360 --> 00:18:00,200
Sir.

172
00:18:00,800 --> 00:18:02,160
Someone is cheating.

173
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:09,000
It's not mine.

174
00:18:09,080 --> 00:18:10,680
Someone tossed it onto my desk.

175
00:18:12,640 --> 00:18:13,800
Who tossed it?

176
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:20,280
Nobody is saying anything?

177
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:22,600
Fine. Continue with the exam.

178
00:18:22,680 --> 00:18:24,920
I will report this
and retrieve CCTV footage.

179
00:18:32,760 --> 00:18:33,600
<i>What happened?</i>

180
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:35,000
Did he really cheat?

181
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:37,680
He was caught red-handed but denied it.

182
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:39,640
I can't believe it.

183
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:42,760
I had finished already. I just…

184
00:18:42,840 --> 00:18:44,200
It was from the rear left.

185
00:18:44,280 --> 00:18:45,480
I'm not sure

186
00:18:45,560 --> 00:18:47,200
from how far away.

187
00:18:47,280 --> 00:18:48,120
Don't worry.

188
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:49,400
We will find out.

189
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:04,040
Give your parents my best.

190
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:05,000
Okay.

191
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:06,120
Bye.

192
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:10,560
Zheng Yu, come.

193
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:16,440
Here. This is yours, right?

194
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:19,240
I cleaned the fridge today.

195
00:19:19,320 --> 00:19:20,880
I opened it and looked.

196
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:22,600
Your rice balls are all expired.

197
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:24,920
Eating those will give you
an upset stomach.

198
00:19:25,680 --> 00:19:28,400
Throw them away.
You haven't eaten them, have you?

199
00:19:30,280 --> 00:19:31,480
No.

200
00:19:31,560 --> 00:19:32,720
Thank goodness.

201
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:35,160
Okay.

202
00:19:41,600 --> 00:19:44,880
CURRY CHICKEN RICE BALL

203
00:20:15,040 --> 00:20:19,720
<i>I don't know when that grain of rice</i>
<i>from the rice ball landed on my sleeve.</i>

204
00:20:21,400 --> 00:20:23,560
<i>It seemed to be reminding me</i>

205
00:20:24,720 --> 00:20:26,800
<i>that the harder you push through life,</i>

206
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:29,240
<i>the more life assumes you can take on.</i>

207
00:20:30,840 --> 00:20:33,440
<i>I stretch everything to its limit.</i>

208
00:20:33,520 --> 00:20:37,200
- Xiaozheng, why are you taking so long?
<i>- Meals.</i>

209
00:20:37,280 --> 00:20:40,360
- <i>Sleep. Energy.</i>
- Are you not feeling well?

210
00:20:41,680 --> 00:20:43,920
<i>As a result, on the one day</i>
<i>I couldn't afford to lose,</i>

211
00:20:45,560 --> 00:20:46,840
<i>I lost to myself.</i>

212
00:20:47,600 --> 00:20:49,280
I'm going to the nursing station.

213
00:20:49,360 --> 00:20:51,600
I'll bring back food
for you while I'm at it.

214
00:21:06,880 --> 00:21:08,840
HOUDE HALL

215
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:10,800
Miss, you wanted to see me?

216
00:21:13,040 --> 00:21:14,400
Take this.

217
00:21:14,480 --> 00:21:16,480
Fill it out and return it.

218
00:21:16,560 --> 00:21:19,440
This is for verifying
low-income students next semester.

219
00:21:19,520 --> 00:21:23,360
Make sure to write down any changes
to your family and economic situation.

220
00:21:25,560 --> 00:21:27,080
Don't go yet. One more thing.

221
00:21:29,040 --> 00:21:32,000
This is the seating chart
on the day of the immunology exam.

222
00:21:32,720 --> 00:21:34,760
You sat near Chen Yanzhou.

223
00:21:34,840 --> 00:21:37,200
The exam was almost over at the time.

224
00:21:37,280 --> 00:21:39,600
Did you see anyone
toss the paper ball to him?

225
00:21:40,960 --> 00:21:41,800
I didn't notice.

226
00:21:43,080 --> 00:21:44,560
Then during the exam,

227
00:21:44,640 --> 00:21:46,760
did you notice anything unusual about him?

228
00:21:51,320 --> 00:21:52,560
No.

229
00:21:55,160 --> 00:21:56,720
Has it not been cleared up yet?

230
00:21:57,560 --> 00:21:59,240
One of the cameras was down.

231
00:21:59,320 --> 00:22:02,400
The other one didn't have anything useful.

232
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:05,200
They were right in the blind spot.

233
00:22:05,280 --> 00:22:06,360
I asked every person.

234
00:22:06,440 --> 00:22:09,400
After questioning for days,
we haven't gotten anywhere.

235
00:22:09,480 --> 00:22:11,560
FALL SEMESTER 2024 EXAM SEATING CHART

236
00:22:20,720 --> 00:22:21,920
What's going on?

237
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:24,960
Didn't we agree not to release
the immunology exam scores?

238
00:22:25,040 --> 00:22:27,560
Why are even the overall rankings out too?

239
00:22:27,640 --> 00:22:28,960
<i>So much time has passed.</i>

240
00:22:29,040 --> 00:22:31,240
<i>Many students are asking for their grades.</i>

241
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:35,560
<i>You question the validity of the scores,</i>
<i>but you haven't filed a report.</i>

242
00:22:35,640 --> 00:22:38,560
<i>I'm merely releasing it</i>
<i>according to procedure.</i>

243
00:22:40,360 --> 00:22:41,880
You can go. I'm busy.

244
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:44,160
If you recall something,
tell me right away.

245
00:22:59,960 --> 00:23:01,320
<i>The GPA rankings are out.</i>

246
00:23:01,400 --> 00:23:02,960
<i>His score wasn't invalidated.</i>

247
00:23:03,040 --> 00:23:03,960
HE DENIED CHEATING

248
00:23:04,040 --> 00:23:06,560
<i>Zheng Yu was supposed to be number one.</i>

249
00:23:06,640 --> 00:23:08,160
<i>What happened? What did I miss?</i>

250
00:23:12,720 --> 00:23:14,560
<i>Done with final exams?</i>

251
00:23:14,640 --> 00:23:16,400
<i>I'm waiting for you to send money.</i>

252
00:23:22,320 --> 00:23:23,880
I would love for this to happen.

253
00:23:30,040 --> 00:23:31,520
Congratulations, Zheng Yu.

254
00:23:33,800 --> 00:23:36,920
Didn't you see the college's notice?

255
00:23:39,920 --> 00:23:42,360
The overall rankings were retracted.

256
00:23:42,440 --> 00:23:44,560
If Chen Yanzhou's cheating is confirmed,

257
00:23:44,640 --> 00:23:46,320
you will probably get the award.

258
00:23:52,040 --> 00:23:53,960
Why haven't you gone home yet?

259
00:23:55,160 --> 00:23:56,560
We got into the cup finals.

260
00:23:56,640 --> 00:24:00,080
I want to stay to revise my thesis
before going home.

261
00:24:00,160 --> 00:24:02,840
The thesis defense is
after the break. Time is tight.

262
00:24:04,000 --> 00:24:07,120
Many people in our major got in.
Didn't you sign up?

263
00:24:18,800 --> 00:24:21,480
CHEN YANZHOU

264
00:24:21,560 --> 00:24:23,320
<i>Did we get into the finals?</i>

265
00:24:27,680 --> 00:24:28,600
<i>Yes.</i>

266
00:24:28,680 --> 00:24:30,360
<i>I'm already refining the thesis.</i>

267
00:24:31,480 --> 00:24:32,480
<i>Where are you?</i>

268
00:24:32,560 --> 00:24:34,160
<i>I'll come find you now.</i>

269
00:24:42,320 --> 00:24:44,360
Why didn't you tell me about the finals?

270
00:24:44,440 --> 00:24:47,800
I haven't seen you around.
I thought you had left already.

271
00:24:48,400 --> 00:24:50,520
There's still some time until the finals.

272
00:24:50,600 --> 00:24:52,640
There isn't much to do. I can handle it.

273
00:24:54,880 --> 00:24:57,640
I searched online
for information about Zhou Guanqi

274
00:24:57,720 --> 00:24:59,800
and presumed to know your mind.

275
00:25:00,720 --> 00:25:03,080
That was wrong of me. I apologize.

276
00:25:05,560 --> 00:25:07,280
But I've said this before.

277
00:25:07,360 --> 00:25:11,160
Since I chose to work with you,
I won't take advantage of you.

278
00:25:11,920 --> 00:25:13,000
See you at the lab tomorrow.

279
00:25:14,160 --> 00:25:15,320
Are you sure

280
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:17,720
you want to go together?

281
00:25:20,000 --> 00:25:21,200
Of course.

282
00:25:33,000 --> 00:25:34,080
This…

283
00:25:40,280 --> 00:25:42,440
Has his matter been sorted out?

284
00:25:42,520 --> 00:25:44,440
There's no concrete evidence.

285
00:25:44,520 --> 00:25:45,920
He hasn't been back long.

286
00:25:46,000 --> 00:25:47,040
He really is unlucky.

287
00:26:03,360 --> 00:26:05,080
When did they get so close?

288
00:26:05,160 --> 00:26:06,000
Who knows?

289
00:26:18,320 --> 00:26:19,440
Zheng Yu,

290
00:26:19,520 --> 00:26:22,920
so you and Chen Yanzhou teamed up
for the Excellence Cup.

291
00:26:31,480 --> 00:26:35,200
Every year, there are a few students
who get caught cheating.

292
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:38,000
They usually have poor grades.

293
00:26:38,080 --> 00:26:40,760
It's the number one student
who was caught this time.

294
00:26:40,840 --> 00:26:44,080
The number one's fall from grace
is huge gossip for many people.

295
00:26:44,720 --> 00:26:47,320
Until proof of his innocence is provided,

296
00:26:48,240 --> 00:26:49,680
the gossip won't stop.

297
00:26:51,280 --> 00:26:52,160
What's your point?

298
00:26:52,240 --> 00:26:54,640
What I mean is,

299
00:26:54,720 --> 00:26:56,320
you and Chen Yanzhou are a team.

300
00:26:56,400 --> 00:26:58,040
You might get dragged into it.

301
00:26:58,840 --> 00:27:00,680
If his cheating is verified,

302
00:27:01,360 --> 00:27:02,880
it could affect your chances.

303
00:27:07,600 --> 00:27:08,600
I'm heading back.

304
00:27:24,040 --> 00:27:26,480
Did that cheat sheet
have anything to do with you?

305
00:27:27,920 --> 00:27:29,240
We're a team.

306
00:27:29,840 --> 00:27:31,360
I want to hear the truth.

307
00:27:34,040 --> 00:27:37,240
I thought you came yesterday
because you believed I didn't cheat,

308
00:27:37,320 --> 00:27:38,480
and we could carry on.

309
00:27:38,560 --> 00:27:40,400
I don't think you cheated.

310
00:27:40,480 --> 00:27:42,080
I just want to get things clear.

311
00:27:42,680 --> 00:27:44,400
I just need an answer from you.

312
00:27:45,000 --> 00:27:46,360
What answer?

313
00:27:47,120 --> 00:27:52,720
Since the first class exam,
you've seemed nervous during every exam.

314
00:27:56,200 --> 00:27:58,960
So from your perspective,
I'm mentally weak

315
00:27:59,040 --> 00:28:01,000
and need a cheat sheet for reassurance.

316
00:28:02,480 --> 00:28:03,680
Let's work separately.

317
00:28:04,280 --> 00:28:06,040
I'll do edits
and supplementary experiments.

318
00:28:06,720 --> 00:28:08,040
You do the defense and slides.

319
00:28:08,800 --> 00:28:11,560
We contribute equally
and don't bother each other.

320
00:28:35,600 --> 00:28:38,160
MR. LI

321
00:28:39,400 --> 00:28:40,240
Hello?

322
00:28:40,320 --> 00:28:41,840
<i>I asked the university.</i>

323
00:28:41,920 --> 00:28:45,280
<i>Things are at a standstill,</i>
<i>but there's no conclusive evidence.</i>

324
00:28:45,360 --> 00:28:48,680
<i>They won't hastily draw conclusions,</i>
<i>so don't worry too much.</i>

325
00:28:48,760 --> 00:28:50,200
I'm not worried.

326
00:28:50,280 --> 00:28:51,160
<i>Good.</i>

327
00:28:51,680 --> 00:28:53,600
<i>The Excellence Cup is what matters.</i>

328
00:28:54,640 --> 00:28:56,600
<i>I'm leading the defense team this year.</i>

329
00:28:56,680 --> 00:28:57,760
<i>Are your slides done?</i>

330
00:28:57,840 --> 00:28:59,720
<i>You can show them to me first.</i>

331
00:29:03,040 --> 00:29:05,320
Zheng Yu is doing them. You can ask her.

332
00:29:05,400 --> 00:29:07,480
<i>What's wrong? Had a falling out?</i>

333
00:29:08,240 --> 00:29:09,160
No.

334
00:29:14,240 --> 00:29:16,080
She asked me if I cheated,

335
00:29:16,160 --> 00:29:18,520
although I already knew
that's just how she is.

336
00:29:19,400 --> 00:29:21,720
Last time, when she heard
I gave you a red packet,

337
00:29:21,800 --> 00:29:23,920
she also came up to me
and asked if it was true.

338
00:29:24,000 --> 00:29:26,440
<i>How did she know about that?</i>

339
00:29:26,520 --> 00:29:27,720
I don't know either.

340
00:29:27,800 --> 00:29:30,080
I think she heard it from someone.

341
00:29:31,920 --> 00:29:35,280
I didn't really mind at the time.
That frankness was nice.

342
00:29:35,880 --> 00:29:37,160
But today,

343
00:29:37,240 --> 00:29:39,640
I felt like those words crossed the line.

344
00:29:40,520 --> 00:29:41,840
<i>I get it.</i>

345
00:29:41,920 --> 00:29:44,400
<i>Back then, a stranger suspected you.</i>

346
00:29:44,480 --> 00:29:46,760
<i>Tonight, a friend doubted you.</i>

347
00:29:46,840 --> 00:29:48,720
<i>That would certainly feel different.</i>

348
00:29:48,800 --> 00:29:51,680
Forget it. Enough talking.
I have to revise my paper.

349
00:29:51,760 --> 00:29:52,960
<i>Okay, carry on. Bye.</i>

350
00:30:06,720 --> 00:30:07,840
…ADJUVANT STRATEGIES…

351
00:30:10,120 --> 00:30:11,200
ON CHEN YANZHOU

352
00:30:17,040 --> 00:30:18,440
ON CHEN YANZHOU

353
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:33,840
Gosh, Linlin!

354
00:30:33,920 --> 00:30:35,240
Check the forum!

355
00:30:35,320 --> 00:30:36,960
A post got bumped up.

356
00:30:37,040 --> 00:30:40,760
Someone asked anonymously about
a top scholar named Zhou Guanqi.

357
00:30:40,840 --> 00:30:42,440
Many people are discussing it.

358
00:30:42,520 --> 00:30:45,120
They say this guy is
Chen Yanzhou's brother.

359
00:30:45,200 --> 00:30:46,440
It has over 100 comments.

360
00:30:47,040 --> 00:30:48,680
What's the title of the post?

361
00:30:48,760 --> 00:30:50,000
It's…

362
00:30:51,400 --> 00:30:52,720
Let me see.

363
00:30:54,040 --> 00:31:00,200
Does anyone know what Qingyi's top scholar
six years ago, Zhou Guanqi, is doing now?

364
00:31:06,840 --> 00:31:09,760
<i>I only know that Zhou Guanqi's brother is</i>
<i>studying biology at Qing Yi University,</i>

365
00:31:09,840 --> 00:31:11,280
<i>same major as his brother.</i>

366
00:31:11,360 --> 00:31:12,760
<i>His name is Chen Yanzhou.</i>

367
00:31:12,840 --> 00:31:15,080
<i>We were in the same lab.</i>

368
00:31:15,160 --> 00:31:17,680
<i>They are brothers?</i>

369
00:31:17,760 --> 00:31:20,160
<i>How smart is Chen Yanzhou?</i>

370
00:31:20,240 --> 00:31:22,280
<i>I recently heard that</i>
<i>he cheated on an exam.</i>

371
00:31:23,080 --> 00:31:25,720
<i>He has been back for so long</i>
<i>and still hasn't returned to the lab.</i>

372
00:31:25,800 --> 00:31:27,040
<i>Judge for yourselves.</i>

373
00:31:29,240 --> 00:31:32,640
<i>Same university, same major.</i>

374
00:31:32,720 --> 00:31:34,760
<i>Why is he copying his brother?</i>

375
00:31:35,840 --> 00:31:38,840
<i>I was wondering how he got into</i>
<i>CXL's lab as a freshman.</i>

376
00:31:38,920 --> 00:31:41,960
<i>Those who know,</i>
<i>know how hard it is to get into CXL's lab.</i>

377
00:31:42,040 --> 00:31:44,480
<i>Did the university give him</i>
<i>special treatment because of his brother?</i>

378
00:31:44,560 --> 00:31:45,920
<i>What happened to his brother?</i>

379
00:31:46,000 --> 00:31:47,080
<i>I found out.</i>

380
00:31:47,160 --> 00:31:50,040
<i>Six years ago, while staying on campus</i>
<i>during the semester break,</i>

381
00:31:50,120 --> 00:31:52,080
<i>ZGQ got into a car accident.</i>

382
00:31:52,160 --> 00:31:54,040
<i>The university had to</i>
<i>bear some responsibility.</i>

383
00:31:54,120 --> 00:31:57,400
<i>Besides, he was a top scholar</i>
<i>who attracted much attention.</i>

384
00:31:57,480 --> 00:31:58,680
<i>Six years ago?</i>

385
00:31:58,760 --> 00:32:00,200
<i>He died when he was just a freshman?</i>

386
00:32:00,280 --> 00:32:02,880
<i>No wonder he wasn't punished for cheating.</i>

387
00:32:02,960 --> 00:32:04,040
<i>I'm in the same college.</i>

388
00:32:04,120 --> 00:32:06,960
<i>I've never heard</i>
<i>about Zhou Guanqi's passing.</i>

389
00:32:07,040 --> 00:32:08,520
<i>The university kept it quiet.</i>

390
00:32:08,600 --> 00:32:11,160
<i>Students in later years</i>
<i>hardly know anything about this.</i>

391
00:32:21,760 --> 00:32:24,640
ARE YOU SURE YOU WANT TO DELETE THIS POST?

392
00:32:28,440 --> 00:32:30,800
THE POST HAS BEEN DELETED

393
00:32:52,080 --> 00:32:53,280
ON CHEN YANZHOU

394
00:33:54,840 --> 00:33:57,960
Why are you here?
Didn't we agree to work separately?

395
00:34:01,840 --> 00:34:05,080
Didn't you say
Mr. Li treats all students fairly?

396
00:34:05,160 --> 00:34:08,280
Even if I ask
to borrow the key, I can get it.

397
00:34:08,360 --> 00:34:10,000
So why can't I be here?

398
00:34:13,960 --> 00:34:16,960
My laptop isn't working.
I couldn't work on the slides.

399
00:34:17,040 --> 00:34:18,719
I came to use the computer.

400
00:34:27,480 --> 00:34:28,639
Did you not sleep?

401
00:34:30,760 --> 00:34:33,239
If you can't finish
editing the paper, I can help.

402
00:34:33,840 --> 00:34:35,120
If you're worried,

403
00:34:35,199 --> 00:34:36,960
you can check it before submission.

404
00:34:41,679 --> 00:34:43,239
You can add this data

405
00:34:43,320 --> 00:34:45,480
from the supplementary experiments.

406
00:34:48,159 --> 00:34:50,639
I need to use the computer here
for a few days.

407
00:34:50,719 --> 00:34:53,000
Will you leave the key in the usual spot?

408
00:34:53,600 --> 00:34:54,520
Not necessarily.

409
00:34:58,440 --> 00:35:01,640
WU FA: PLAYING DEAD?

410
00:35:25,160 --> 00:35:27,760
TABLE OF CONTENTS: 1: BACKGROUND,
2: METHODS, 3: RESULTS, 4: SUMMARY

411
00:35:59,920 --> 00:36:02,280
- Hello.
<i>- I was just about to call you.</i>

412
00:36:02,360 --> 00:36:04,840
<i>I have a classmate who works</i>
<i>at a biotech company.</i>

413
00:36:05,440 --> 00:36:08,120
<i>They need a freelancer</i>
<i>for document translations.</i>

414
00:36:08,200 --> 00:36:10,560
<i>- I'll add you to the group chat.</i>
- Okay.

415
00:36:10,640 --> 00:36:13,000
<i>By the way, why were you calling me?</i>

416
00:36:13,880 --> 00:36:16,440
Can you ask agencies you know

417
00:36:16,520 --> 00:36:18,280
if any tutoring positions are open?

418
00:36:18,360 --> 00:36:20,040
Preferably close to campus.

419
00:36:20,120 --> 00:36:22,560
<i>Wasn't your tutoring gig going well?</i>

420
00:36:23,400 --> 00:36:24,800
<i>I heard the agent say</i>

421
00:36:24,880 --> 00:36:27,720
<i>the kid's final exam results</i>
<i>improved significantly.</i>

422
00:36:27,800 --> 00:36:30,760
<i>Won't another gig</i>
<i>be too much on your plate?</i>

423
00:36:31,640 --> 00:36:34,240
I have to pay off a huge debt.

424
00:36:47,960 --> 00:36:49,160
Twenty-two yuan.

425
00:36:50,120 --> 00:36:52,440
About the perfume money…

426
00:36:53,320 --> 00:36:54,160
It's okay.

427
00:36:54,240 --> 00:36:57,040
If you don't have the cash,
you can pay me next semester.

428
00:37:00,600 --> 00:37:02,120
It's the Lunar New Year soon.

429
00:37:02,200 --> 00:37:05,200
When I get my red packets,
I can buy more perfume.

430
00:37:09,840 --> 00:37:10,960
Okay.

431
00:37:13,000 --> 00:37:15,360
Don't get me wrong. I'm not being nice.

432
00:37:16,200 --> 00:37:19,960
I know someone won the Vitality Award
using dishonorable methods.

433
00:37:20,040 --> 00:37:21,520
You can't get the money yet.

434
00:37:26,080 --> 00:37:27,280
Bye.

435
00:37:44,280 --> 00:37:47,000
Go.

436
00:37:48,160 --> 00:37:49,600
Chen Yanzhou,

437
00:37:49,680 --> 00:37:51,720
I want to ask you something.

438
00:37:52,400 --> 00:37:53,960
What is it?

439
00:37:55,880 --> 00:37:57,360
I'm asking for a freshman.

440
00:37:57,960 --> 00:38:01,680
Doesn't Cheng Xiulin's lab
rarely recruit freshmen?

441
00:38:01,760 --> 00:38:04,720
When you were a freshman,
how did you get in?

442
00:38:04,800 --> 00:38:06,080
Share your experience.

443
00:38:06,680 --> 00:38:09,520
On the forum,
it said that Zhou Guanqi was your brother.

444
00:38:10,520 --> 00:38:13,720
You had such a smart brother.
Why haven't you mentioned him?

445
00:38:14,720 --> 00:38:16,920
Cheng Xiulin and Li Yanan both taught him.

446
00:38:17,000 --> 00:38:18,640
No wonder they treat you so well.

447
00:38:19,840 --> 00:38:21,600
The university even
deleted the post for you.

448
00:38:22,840 --> 00:38:24,160
I really envy you.

449
00:38:27,400 --> 00:38:29,600
If your brain is fried,
cool off over there.

450
00:38:38,600 --> 00:38:40,320
I told you I didn't want to go.

451
00:38:41,720 --> 00:38:43,280
I'm going to the restroom.

452
00:38:43,360 --> 00:38:44,800
ZHANG XINRAN, CHEN YANZHOU…

453
00:38:52,720 --> 00:38:56,520
Zheng Yu, we're going out
to eat later. Will you join us?

454
00:38:57,680 --> 00:38:59,200
I came late. I'm not done yet.

455
00:39:01,320 --> 00:39:02,320
ZHENG YU

456
00:39:02,400 --> 00:39:03,800
CHEN YANZHOU

457
00:39:04,400 --> 00:39:07,040
Do you believe Chen Yanzhou didn't cheat?

458
00:39:11,960 --> 00:39:13,800
I just think you were right.

459
00:39:13,880 --> 00:39:15,840
The two of us are competing in a team.

460
00:39:16,440 --> 00:39:18,920
Proving his innocence
will be for the best.

461
00:39:26,040 --> 00:39:27,720
RECENT CALLS

462
00:39:27,800 --> 00:39:28,760
ZHENG YU

463
00:39:53,920 --> 00:39:55,680
Let's put these together.

464
00:39:58,280 --> 00:40:01,880
Zheng Yu, how come you weren't
at the lab this morning?

465
00:40:01,960 --> 00:40:02,800
I had a gig.

466
00:40:14,320 --> 00:40:15,800
ON CHEN YANZHOU

467
00:40:24,920 --> 00:40:27,720
Did Chen Yanzhou go to the lab today?

468
00:40:27,800 --> 00:40:30,200
Yes. He sat in front of me.

469
00:40:37,840 --> 00:40:40,400
<i>Can you lend me the key to the old lab?</i>

470
00:40:40,480 --> 00:40:41,920
<i>My laptop isn't fixed yet.</i>

471
00:40:45,840 --> 00:40:47,720
CHEN YANZHOU

472
00:41:03,640 --> 00:41:05,640
Didn't you swear you would ignore her?

473
00:41:06,320 --> 00:41:08,120
She broke the ice first.

474
00:41:08,800 --> 00:41:09,920
When did she do that?

475
00:41:10,520 --> 00:41:13,240
It was that forum post.
She asked for gossip.

476
00:41:16,480 --> 00:41:17,760
Let's continue.

477
00:41:37,880 --> 00:41:39,560
- What is it?
- Is Chen Yanzhou here?

478
00:41:40,920 --> 00:41:43,320
No. If that's all, I'm closing the door.

479
00:41:43,400 --> 00:41:45,880
If the smell gets out,
we'll get scolded again.

480
00:42:02,920 --> 00:42:04,840
CHEN YANZHOU

481
00:42:32,600 --> 00:42:34,000
OLD

482
00:43:24,720 --> 00:43:26,960
<i>Can you lend me the key to the old lab?</i>

483
00:43:27,040 --> 00:43:28,680
<i>My laptop isn't fixed yet.</i>

484
00:43:57,720 --> 00:43:58,840
WU FA

485
00:44:07,440 --> 00:44:09,920
JUST NOW

486
00:44:20,680 --> 00:44:21,680
Hello?

487
00:44:21,760 --> 00:44:24,080
<i>You finally picked up.</i>

488
00:44:24,160 --> 00:44:26,840
<i>Where's this semester's 30,000 yuan?</i>

489
00:44:26,920 --> 00:44:31,120
<i>Did you not get</i>
<i>that lousy award money this time?</i>

490
00:44:31,920 --> 00:44:34,320
There were special circumstances
this time.

491
00:44:34,400 --> 00:44:36,600
<i>We had an agreement.</i>

492
00:44:36,680 --> 00:44:39,440
<i>You pay 30,000 yuan</i>
<i>at the end of every semester,</i>

493
00:44:39,520 --> 00:44:42,280
<i>and we won't show up in your life.</i>

494
00:44:42,360 --> 00:44:46,040
<i>If even one bit of it is missing,</i>
<i>don't blame us for breaking the agreement.</i>

495
00:44:46,120 --> 00:44:49,360
<i>We've found the hospital</i>
<i>where your mother is.</i>

496
00:44:49,440 --> 00:44:51,000
<i>It's only a matter of time</i>

497
00:44:51,080 --> 00:44:54,600
<i>before we locate her ward</i>
<i>as well as where you're studying.</i>

498
00:44:56,040 --> 00:44:57,680
Don't worry.

499
00:44:57,760 --> 00:45:00,840
You will get the full 30,000 yuan.

500
00:45:00,920 --> 00:45:02,360
<i>So where's the money now?</i>

501
00:45:03,400 --> 00:45:04,560
<i>Say something.</i>

502
00:45:05,400 --> 00:45:06,360
<i>Talk!</i>

503
00:45:07,160 --> 00:45:08,400
This time,

504
00:45:09,280 --> 00:45:11,720
someone cheated and ranked number one.

505
00:45:13,320 --> 00:45:14,680
So it has been delayed.

506
00:45:14,760 --> 00:45:16,120
The university is handling it.

507
00:45:16,720 --> 00:45:19,200
When it's over,
they will send me the money.

508
00:45:20,040 --> 00:45:22,240
<i>You had better not be lying.</i>

509
00:45:22,320 --> 00:45:25,600
<i>Otherwise, you know the consequences.</i>

510
00:45:40,080 --> 00:45:41,320
<i>This time,</i>

511
00:45:42,200 --> 00:45:45,320
<i>someone cheated and ranked number one.</i>

512
00:45:46,240 --> 00:45:47,680
<i>So it has been delayed.</i>

513
00:45:51,240 --> 00:45:53,800
ON THE IMMUNE-ENHANCING EFFECT
OF PARTICULATE…

514
00:45:53,880 --> 00:45:55,040
ZHENG YU

515
00:45:55,120 --> 00:45:57,080
<i>Are you going to the defense?</i>

516
00:46:00,840 --> 00:46:01,960
<i>No.</i>

517
00:46:04,480 --> 00:46:06,960
<i>What about the networking event</i>
<i>in two days?</i>

518
00:46:07,040 --> 00:46:09,120
<i>Past winners will share their experience.</i>

519
00:46:11,000 --> 00:46:12,240
<i>No.</i>

520
00:46:18,160 --> 00:46:19,240
<i>Okay.</i>

521
00:46:40,960 --> 00:46:42,440
Did you just leave?

522
00:46:43,360 --> 00:46:45,360
It's so late. Why are you still here?

523
00:46:45,440 --> 00:46:48,240
I just finished coaching
a few competing teams.

524
00:46:49,040 --> 00:46:52,280
By the way, Zheng Yu sent me
the slides for your defense.

525
00:46:52,360 --> 00:46:55,200
I've already told her what to revise.

526
00:46:55,280 --> 00:46:56,640
Did she send them to you?

527
00:46:58,680 --> 00:47:00,680
Are you two still upset with each other?

528
00:47:03,200 --> 00:47:06,160
When two people have a common goal
and work together,

529
00:47:06,240 --> 00:47:07,880
the illusion
of mutual connection develops.

530
00:47:08,480 --> 00:47:10,320
When a conflict of interest arises,

531
00:47:10,400 --> 00:47:12,080
that illusion quickly shatters.

532
00:47:12,680 --> 00:47:16,200
Resolve this yourselves.
Don't let it affect the competition, okay?

533
00:47:16,880 --> 00:47:19,640
Are you going
to the networking event in two days?

534
00:47:20,520 --> 00:47:22,520
My mom will do waste sorting outreach.

535
00:47:22,600 --> 00:47:25,160
- I'm helping out.
- Sorting waste won't take all day.

536
00:47:25,240 --> 00:47:26,320
Come by after that.

537
00:47:27,800 --> 00:47:29,040
Waste sorting outreach.

538
00:47:30,960 --> 00:47:32,720
Waste sorting, right…

539
00:47:48,320 --> 00:47:49,760
LEFU YAYUAN

540
00:48:30,040 --> 00:48:32,560
I'm just saying hi. No need to overreact.

541
00:48:33,160 --> 00:48:36,280
Do you think
your way of "saying hi" is polite?

542
00:48:36,800 --> 00:48:39,080
Sorry, I was too impatient.

543
00:48:40,760 --> 00:48:41,760
What do you want?

544
00:48:43,120 --> 00:48:45,520
I heard at the networking event

545
00:48:45,600 --> 00:48:48,040
that the project you and Chen Yanzhou
are doing is going well.

546
00:48:48,640 --> 00:48:50,280
The teachers and judges like it.

547
00:48:50,360 --> 00:48:51,680
It seems

548
00:48:52,360 --> 00:48:53,360
you two get along.

549
00:48:54,840 --> 00:48:56,920
Don't concern yourself with our matters.

550
00:48:58,080 --> 00:48:59,920
That's not what I'm concerned about.

551
00:49:00,520 --> 00:49:01,760
It's your future.

552
00:49:01,840 --> 00:49:03,640
You had better pray

553
00:49:03,720 --> 00:49:05,920
that you don't win the Excellence Cup.

554
00:49:06,000 --> 00:49:08,880
Chen Yanzhou was just rumored
to have cheated.

555
00:49:09,480 --> 00:49:11,800
Do you think everyone will stand for it?

556
00:49:11,880 --> 00:49:12,800
It's 20,000 yuan.

557
00:49:12,880 --> 00:49:15,520
It's a lot of money.
Many people will be envious.

558
00:49:15,600 --> 00:49:19,000
As his partner, be careful of
getting caught in the crosshairs.

559
00:49:20,240 --> 00:49:21,360
Don't worry about it.

560
00:49:22,440 --> 00:49:23,280
Zheng Yu.

561
00:49:26,800 --> 00:49:31,160
You must want to know what happened
during the immunology exam.
